{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;All one click&quot; is an Action-RPG that reduces player input to the most exciting part of every RPG: the level-up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill monsters, collect XP, level up your character and climb the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You either choose actively what skills to take and upgrade or test your luck and let it choose randomly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned: every click counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588750/extras/2ae0bc1e0d8cad0551b6271bd8b34eda.poster.avif?t=1761051116\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588750/extras/2ae0bc1e0d8cad0551b6271bd8b34eda.webm?t=1761051116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588750/extras/2ae0bc1e0d8cad0551b6271bd8b34eda.mp4?t=1761051116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it a game at all, is it a non-game, is it a social experiment or just a meta-commentary on the eveolution of the RPG genre over the past decades?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow &quot;Out of the Box Games&quot; on social media for regular updates.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2588750?t=1761051116","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2588750?t=1761051116","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588750/551932f96fd94ac35b01315d1abe80a1c8b3f29b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761051116","capsule_image